CSS:
   -> stand for cascading style sheet  
   -> used increase standards and overall look of web page to make it presentable.
   -> with Css user can Understand the web page content easily by making UI as rich.
   -> History:
         -> CSS invert in W3C(consortium) on 17th dec, 1996 by hackon wiem Lie.
   -> uses
         -> Improves looks.
         -> Separates content and design.
         -> maintains consistancy across multiple pages.
         -> Make web pages as responsive for different types of devices(mobile, tablets, laptop).
         -> Reduce code duplication.
         -> Adds visuals effect like animation, transition , transformation.

How to use CSS?

    selector {
        prop : value;

    }
    -> Selector : targetting HTML element by using its name , id , class.
    -> Declaration block contains one or more Css Declaration Separated by ";".
    _. one declartion contains css property name  and value seperated by ":".
    We can not write duplicate property in same declartion block, if it is so always last occurance will executes.

How Css Works?

-> when CSs loaded into the broweser , tree like struct called CSSOM(Cascading style sheet object model) will be created after parsing css in browser.
-> just like as the browser converts html into a DOM(Document Object Model), it converts css into CSSOM
-> Later browser will combines both DOM and CSSOM to create a render tree.


          HTML                CSS
           |                   |
       HTML Parser         CSS Parser
           |                   |
          DOM                 CSSOM
           \                  /
            \                /
             \              /
              \            /
               \          /
                Render Tree
                     |  
    Layout(Calculating the size & Position)
                     |
    Painting(Applies colors.borders.shadows)
    